Z||000000||bcwawright||05-18-2001||01:50 PM||||Does anyone know where I can get Stainless Steel or Chromed spark plug covers??<BR>Thanks<P>Bruce<BR>88GT Turbo Spyder F355||||reg||5
Z||000001||Bruce||05-18-2001||08:15 PM||||You might try Kick Hill Farms, which deals in a number of used Fiero Parts. They have a web site, of you can call the The Fiero Store and they'll put you in touch. Very good service and good used parts. I bought a chime box and a back -up light switch and have had no problems.||||reg||1
Z||000002||PBJ||05-18-2001||08:24 PM||||You can also buy them still at the GM dealer. They have been used on all types  of GM engines and I believe are still used on some today. They are not specific for Fiero.||||reg||1
